mod.sources, but it is HUGE (about 20 postings), and I'll be DAMNED (can I
say that on the net?) if I am going to send extra copies of lost portions to
all those sites on the net that have flakey news connections, or spool files
too small to hold the whole thing.  (Remember, I've got a job, and a home life,
and I even like to sleep, occasionally).  If I DID post it, I would have to
space it out over several days to avoid overflowing the disks on our
neighboring sites (notably, decvax).

